  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Jerash is riding a clear demand upswing, fueled by new customer wins and a strong recovery in export shipments. The period capped a record-revenue year, with broad-based volume growth that lifted activity well beyond prior-year levels. End-market appetite for its manufactured apparel appears robust, and the company’s core operation is gaining momentum without signs of softening in its orders or customer pipeline.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership executed a sharp operational turnaround, delivering a profit against expectations of a loss and beating estimates decisively. Tight expense control generated meaningful operating leverage, restoring profitability and reversing a year-ago loss. The team’s confidence in sustained demand, combined with the market’s very positive reception and subsequent technical strength, signals growing credibility that management can convert improving conditions into durable execution.",
